OL,3,GNEWSA'They disgust me': The fight for
OL,4,Asmaller breasts
OL,5,
OL,6,FBack pain, rashes, harassment and a bad
OL,7,Fsmell.
OL,9,FThese are just some of the reasons why
OL,10,FCharlotte Howard, 52, from West
OL,11,FLavington, says she is "disgusted" by
OL,12,Fher own breasts.
OL,14,FOnce measuring at a 32B, they soon grew
OL,15,Fto a 40GG when she started the
OL,16,Fmenopause.
OL,18,F"I find them intolerable. I'm basically
OL,19,Fcarrying half a stone off my neck and
OL,20,Fshoulders. I can't look at myself
OL,21,Fwithout clothes on," she says.
